y armor commonly worn by soldiers."},"defenceVal":"6","price":"2000","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1019905","name":{"zh":"铁盔·丁","en":"Iron Helm - IV"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"战场上最常见的铁盔，从大将到伍长都有可能佩戴，偶尔会加些个人风格的装饰。","en":"The most common iron helm on the battlefield, worn by everyone from generals to squad leaders, sometimes with personal decorations added."},"defenceVal":"4","price":"2200","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}},{"id":"WP1001315","name":{"zh":"乌丸马","en":"Wuwan Horse"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"来自乌丸部族的战马，其骑兵被誉为 “天下名骑” 。","en":"A warhorse from the Wuhuan tribe, whose cavalry are hailed as ‘the finest riders under heaven’."},"price":"900","slot":{"zh":"坐骑","en":"Mount"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10334","code":"0"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI110415","name":{"zh":"丘力居氏","en":"The Qiuliju clan"},"years":["0","207"],"desc":{"zh":"出自东胡，乌桓为东胡别支。丘力居为辽西乌桓大人，统领五千余落。辽西乌桓大人丘力居，自称王。中平四年与张纯、张举起兵反汉，寇略青、徐、幽、冀四州，后归顺幽州牧刘虞。初平年间去世后，其从子蹋顿代立，总摄三郡乌桓。建安十二年，曹操北征乌桓，在白狼山之战斩杀蹋顿，乌桓自此衰落。","en":"Originating from the Donghu, the Wuhuan were an offshoot branch of the Donghu. Qiu Lijiu was a chieftain of the Liaoxi Wuhuan, commanding over 5,000 settlements. Chieftain Qiu Lijiu of the Liaoxi Wuhuan proclaimed himself King. In the 4th year of Zhongping, he took up arms alongside Zhang Chun and Zhang Ju against the Han, raiding Qing, Xu, You, and Ji Provinces, before eventually submitting to Liu Yu, Governor of You Province. Following his death in the Chuping era, his nephew Tadun succeeded him, overseeing the Wuhuan across three commanderies. In the 12th year of Jian'an, Cao Cao campaigned North against the Wuhuan and slew Tadun at the Battle of White Wolf Mountain, after which the Wuhuan fell into decline."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"5","politics":"4"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPre