:"CS1007","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,72,35,35,37,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1001005","helmet":"WP1019905","horse":"WP1001315"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10334","city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,72,35,35,37,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1001005","helmet":"WP1019905","horse":"WP1001315"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"辽西少数部族，乌丸单于丘力居之子。在曹操追剿袁氏残党期间，楼班率兵救援袁熙、袁尚，被曹操击败后又逃至辽东，被公孙康所杀。楼班死后，首级又被公孙康献于曹操。","tc":"遼西少數部族，烏丸單于丘力居之子。在曹操追剿袁氏殘黨期間，樓班率兵救援袁熙、袁尚，被曹操擊敗后又逃至遼東，被公孫康所殺。樓班死后，首級又被公孫康獻于曹操。","en":"From a Liaoxi tribe, he was the son of the Wuwan Chanyu Qiuliju. During Cao Cao's campaign against the Yuan remnants, Louban led troops to aid Yuan Xi and Yuan Shang, but was defeated by Cao Cao and fled to Liaodong, where he was killed by Gongsun Kang. After Louban's death, his severed head was presented to Cao Cao by Gongsun Kang.","jp":"遼西の少数部族出身で、烏丸単于・丘力居の子。曹操が袁氏の残党を追討した際、楼班は兵を率いて袁煕・袁尚の救援に向かったが曹操に敗れ、遼東へと逃走したものの公孫康に殺害された。楼班の死後、その首級は公孫康によって曹操へ献じられた。","kr":"요서의 소수 부족인 오환 선우 구력거의 아들. 조조가 원씨 잔당을 소탕할 당시 군사를 이끌고 원희와 원상을 구원했으나 조조에게 패배한 후 요동으로 달아났다가 공손강에게 살해되었다. 누반이 죽은 뒤 공손강은 그의 수급을 조조에게 바쳤다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10395","remark":"","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"楼班","nameTc":"樓班","nameEn":"Louban","nameJp":"楼班","nameKr":"누반","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"楼班","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0